---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Metronome from "../components/Metronome.astro";
---
<Layout title="Metronome" description="Metronome with 1, 2, 3 or 4 notes per click, tap tempo, +5 steps.">
  <h1>Metronome</h1>
  <Metronome id="main" bpm={60} subdiv={1} />
  <p class="small muted">Accent on beat 1. Numbers under the tempo are notes per click: 1 for the crawl, 4 for the picking drill. +5 is the pass step. Tap four times to set a tempo from a song. Screen stays on while it runs.</p>
  <h2>Rules that go with it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The right practice tempo is the fastest one with zero mistakes.</li>
    <li>Three clean passes in a row, then +5. One miss, stay.</li>
    <li>Clean and even beats fast and ragged. Always.</li>
  </ul>
</Layout>
